  "title": "Im, am, um, von … bis",
  "subtitle": "Prepositions of time",
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "type": "overview",
      "label": "Überblick",
      "title": "Lesson intro",
      "minutes": 40,
      "learn": [
        "am for days and parts of the day: am Montag, am Morgen. The night is the exception: in der Nacht.",
        "um for the clock: um acht Uhr. im for months and seasons: im Winter.",
        "nach and vor take the dative: nach dem Essen, vor dem Essen.",
        "seit looks back to a start that still holds. ab looks forward to a start. von … bis is the span."
      ],
